OBJECTIVE
====================================================================

Build a production-ready Result Processing and Response Aggregation layer.

Input:

ExecutionResult / ExecutionResults
IntentResult
RouteDecision
ExecutionPlan
ExecutionContext

Output:

AggregatedResponse

The aggregator must:

1. Validate execution results
2. Normalize result structures
3. Order results deterministically
4. Separate successful/failed/partial/cancelled results
5. Resolve step dependencies
6. Aggregate outputs
7. Preserve errors
8. Generate warnings
9. Calculate final status
10. Generate safe metadata/statistics
11. Produce a final orchestration result

No LLM should be used to rewrite or summarize the response.

